    "Accumulation on the Smart Inflow tape: BUTTHOLE (three wallets First Buy: 8gV3...H13U +$178.4, Eq7k...afeA +$159.4, and CxWR...Vrz4 +$150); Brian (three wallets First Buy: Eq7k...afeA +$61.81, 8gV3...H13U +$71.3, and CxWR...Vrz4 +$72.76); ANTHROPIC (three wallets Buy More: Eq7k...afeA +$315.1, 8gV3...H13U +$344.8, and CxWR...Vrz4 +$325.1); WORLDCRAFT (two wallets First Buy: C4er...1fWG +$21.57 and FnKY...mDgS +$0.007); scat (two wallets First Buy: 6cwa...bWTd +$14.81 and 7BVp...M5FX +$209.5); microsoft (two wallets First Buy: 74iF...gdnK +$105.8 and 6yxo...BibW +$102.5); AI (two wallets First Buy: GZDR...m7ui +$63.7 and B3wb...dUKx +$40.93); NVDA (two wallets Buy More: 5iFf...Nn4E +$38.45 and B3ZV...2adt +$31.82). Single-wallet First Buys also printed for CRIMECAT (3T36...pump), Lemon, HACKER, Robinu, and CRIME.",
