    "Risk flags: Dev Sell All (DS) on CRIME, BAWSAQ, GTA6, BRUTAL, BANK, WHOAPED, KOL, SENT, and AI. Ignite showed 0.2% at the Dev badge (not DS). Bundlers: CRIME 26%, BAWSAQ 0.1%, GTA6 15%, BRUTAL 12%, BANK 17%, WHOAPED 4%, KOL 13%, SENT 5%, AI 13%, Ignite 32%. Phishing: CRIME 6%, BAWSAQ 0%, GTA6 6%, BRUTAL 3%, BANK 18%, WHOAPED 3%, KOL 20%, SENT 10%, AI 4%, Ignite 1%. Highest sniper: KOL 5.97%. Highest insider: WHOAPED and SENT 24%. Highest top-10 holder: CRIME 64.93%. Paid/CTO badges: BAWSAQ $4298 CTO, BANK $299 CTO, WHOAPED $398 CTO, KOL $299, SENT $299 CTO; CRIME, GTA6, BRUTAL, AI, and Ignite Unpaid. No textual honeypot, mint, or freeze flag was visible. Holder-rewards badges appeared on CRIME 0.95%, BANK 1%, and KOL 0.3%. BANK also showed a WBTC tag.",
